 "caption": {
  "en": "Price makes a higher high at bar 55 but RSI makes a lower high. Sell only after price closes below the swing low between the two highs.",
  "bn": "55 নম্বর bar-এ দাম higher high করে কিন্তু RSI lower high করে। দুই high-এর মাঝের swing low-এর নিচে close হলেই sell।"
 },
 "notes": {
  "en": "Illustrative synthetic data.",
  "bn": "এটি শিক্ষামূলক কাল্পনিক ডেটা।"
 },
 "explanation": {
  "en": "Divergence warns that momentum is fading. The trigger is a structure break, and the stop sits above the second high.",
  "bn": "Divergence সতর্ক করে যে momentum কমছে। Trigger হলো structure break, আর stop বসে দ্বিতীয় high-এর ওপরে।"
 },
 "keyTakeaways": [
  {
   "en": "Divergence is a warning; the structure break is the trigger",
   "bn": "Divergence সতর্কবার্তা; structure break হলো trigger"
  }
 ],
